  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Food Security Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Pacific Food Security initiative comprises a portfolio of activities to support resilient agriculture in the Pacific. It assists smallholders to transform the way they grow and access food including improved access to more nutritious food and increase the availability and affordability of local, nutritious foods which are vital for health and long-term wellbeing.</narrative>
  </description>
